  "body": "Red on the Windows box (xiaomi-gpu, Windows 11, Go 1.26.8) in a full `go test -timeout 45m ./...` through win-run at main 373cab2b0 (2026-11-05). Windows CI only compiles the tests, so nothing else shows it (#1827). Unrelated to 373cab2b0, which changes only the Cursor mover's min string.\n\nPackage: internal/agent\n\n```\n--- FAIL: TestMiseShimWindowsFiveAgents (0.10s)\n    cliupdate_shim_test.go:319: claude: &{via:npm pkg:@anthropic-ai/claude-code cask:false brew: cmd:[C:\\Users\\yeton\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\TestMiseShimWindowsFiveAgents2777633906\\001\\Users\\flp\\AppData\\Local\\mise\\installs\\node\\24.20.0\\npm.cmd install -g --prefix C:\\Users\\yeton\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\TestMiseShimWindowsFiveAgents2777633906\\001\\Users\\flp\\AppData\\Local\\mise\\installs\\node\\24.20.0 --allow-scripts=@anthropic-ai/claude-code @anthropic-ai/claude-code@latest] path:C:\\Users\\yeton\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\TestMiseShimWindowsFiveAgents2777633906\\001\\Users\\flp\\AppData\\Local\\mise\\installs\\node\\24.20.0 admin:false prefix:C:\\Users\\yeton\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\TestMiseShimWindowsFiveAgents2777633906\\001\\Users\\flp\\AppData\\Local\\mise\\installs\\node\\24.20.0 latest:<nil> reshim:[C:\\Users\\yeton\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\TestMiseShimWindowsFiveAgents2777633906\\001\\mise\\bin\\mise.exe reshim]}\n    cliupdate_shim_test.go:319: opencode: &{via:npm pkg:opencode-ai cask:false brew: cmd:[C:\\Users\\yeton\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\TestMiseShimWindowsFiveAgents2777633906\\001\\Users\\flp\\AppData\\Local\\mise\\installs\\node\\24.20.0\\npm.cmd install -g --prefix C:\\Users\\yeton\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\TestMiseShimWindowsFiveAgents2777633906\\001\\Users\\flp\\AppData\\Local\\mise\\installs\\node\\24.20.0 --allow-scripts=opencode-ai opencode-ai@latest] path:C:\\Users\\yeton\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\TestMiseShimWindowsFiveAgents2777633906\\001\\Users\\flp\\AppData\\Local\\mise\\installs\\node\\24.20.0 admin:false prefix:C:\\Users\\yeton\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\TestMise