   "body": "A test-only fix is on [the fork branch](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/tree/fix/5343-mise-script-permissions), commit [9dd52caa1](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/commit/9dd52caa1835b78f4e85a2a6f562d45ba8f1bc3a), based on ed0ab567.\n\nThe mise Windows assertion predates package-scoped install-script permissions. Its expected argv now includes `--allow-scripts=<package>` for Claude and OpenCode, and still omits it for Pi, Codex and CodeBuddy. It retains exact checks for npm, prefix, package, resolved executable and mise reshim; production behavior is unchanged.\n\nFocused mise, installation detection and script-permission tests pass with race. The Windows amd64 test binary cross-compiles, agent vet and the full offline nogui build pass. Native Windows execution was not available; the exact failure in this report establishes the old assertion mismatch. AI-assisted implementation and review.",
